            {
              "c": "唔好",
              "j": "m4 hou2",
              "e": "don't"
            },
            {
              "c": "食咁多",
              "j": "sik6 gam3 do1",
              "e": "eat so much"
            },
            {
              "c": "宵夜",
              "j": "siu1 je2",
              "e": "late-night food"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "body-t2-s13",
          "c": "如果食咗藥都唔好返，就要去醫院喇。",
          "j": "jyu4 gwo2 sik6 zo2 joek6 dou1 m4 hou2 faan1, zau6 jiu3 heoi3 ji1 jyun2 laa3.",
          "e": "If you've taken medicine and still don't get better, then you need to go to hospital.",
          "note": "如果…就 (jyu4 gwo2…zau6) \"if…then\" is useful for medical conditionals: if symptoms persist → take action. 好返 (hou2 faan1) \"recover / get better\" — literally \"good again\".",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "如果",
              "j": "jyu4 gwo2",
              "e": "if"
            },
            {
              "c": "食咗藥",
